Không có tiêu đề/
# Per-video caption scripts (auto-saved by bridge)
scripts/*/
web/saved-items/out/
web/saved-items/.next/

# Extension popup build output. COMMITTED on purpose: extension/popup/index.html is a
# tracked file that references these chunks, and the toolbar icon opens it directly, so
# ignoring them made a fresh clone render a blank Saved Items page with no error
# anywhere. Regenerate with `cd web/saved-items && npm run build:extension` and commit
# the result; scripts/verify_extension_popup.js (run in CI) fails if they drift apart.

# Temporary scripts and agent output
patch_*.py
